"h.providers.t" = "AI Providers";
"h.providers.d" = "Left side, bottom of the rail (like Appearance on the right). Two tabs. Voices: connect Google (Gemini API key, tested and kept for every project); Apple voices give each scene a free Quick preview. AI Agent: who answers the chat and rewrites scenes — Apple, Ollama, OpenAI, Gemini or Claude. Opens by itself until Google is connected.";
"h.projects.t" = "Recent Projects";
"h.projects.d" = "Left side: projects you opened before. Search by name, click to open. Open Project… brings in a project exported from another Mac. Projects save automatically; Export Project (toolbar) makes the file to take with you.";
"h.model.t" = "Model";
"h.model.d" = "Every project uses one Gemini TTS model, chosen when you create it and shown under the name. Change says what changes: scene previews need generating again, Thai support and price follow; scenes, voices and old takes stay.";
"h.timeline.t" = "Script Timeline";
"h.timeline.d" = "Every line (Script) and every breath or pause (Expression) is a scene. Drag ⋮⋮ to reorder, {speaker.slash} to leave a scene out of the take, click to edit it on the right.";
"h.scene.t" = "Current Scene";
"h.scene.d" = "Script: the voice (drag from Voice Library), the style (drag from its Styles tab or type), the text, and the preview of this scene only (Generate preview → Ready → Play). Expression: the current one; change it from Expression Library.";
"h.exprs.t" = "Expression Library";
"h.exprs.d" = "Right side. Breath, pauses, laugh, sigh, gasp, cough. Drag onto the timeline to insert, onto the Current Scene to change, or press Apply.";
"h.history.t" = "History";
"h.history.d" = "Right side, top. Two tabs of 30. Script: the open project's last edits, newest first; {pin.fill} pins a version, and the project as opened is pinned for you. Scene: the last versions of the scenes' text — going back changes only that scene. Double-click a row or press ↩ to go back — going back is a new step too, so nothing is lost. Each project keeps its own History.";
"h.gen.t" = "Generate";
"h.gen.d" = "Right side. Preview of the whole project (every scene that isn’t muted), model, Generate with Gemini (⌘↵), then play, download or delete each result.";
"h.voices.t" = "Voice Library";
"h.voices.d" = "Google's whole Gemini TTS library — 2,000+ voices, the same as AI Studio; the 30 with portraits come first. Search, filter ♂ ♀, ♥ favourites or ✓ voices in this project, then drag a voice onto the scene or press Apply.";
"h.ai.t" = "AI Agent";
"h.ai.d" = "Ask the AI Agent about the project: a better opening line, where to pause, a translation. Choose who answers — Apple, Ollama, OpenAI, Gemini or Claude — with ⚙ or in AI Providers › AI Agent. It answers; you change the scenes yourself.";

